WEBVTT

1
00:00:05.700 --> 00:00:07.883
In fractions, times means 'of'.

2
00:00:08.867 --> 00:00:11.561
Let's find two thirds times three quarters.

3
00:00:13.533 --> 00:00:15.158
This square is one whole.

4
00:00:19.133 --> 00:00:23.080
Cut it into 3 columns. Colour 2. That is two thirds.

5
00:00:27.067 --> 00:00:31.479
Cut it into 4 rows. Colour 3. That is three quarters.

6
00:00:34.467 --> 00:00:36.789
The answer is where the colours overlap.

7
00:00:40.767 --> 00:00:42.578
6 small boxes overlap.

8
00:00:43.567 --> 00:00:45.982
There are 12 small boxes in total.

9
00:00:47.967 --> 00:00:51.404
So two thirds times three quarters equals six twelfths.

10
00:00:53.400 --> 00:00:55.768
Shortcut: multiply the tops.

11
00:00:57.767 --> 00:00:59.346
Then multiply the bottoms.

12
00:01:04.333 --> 00:01:07.212
Tops times tops. Bottoms times bottoms.
